  "details": "Groups are great!\n\nBut a lot of them are used for the sole purpose of having a funny banner.\n\nActual \"communities\" are pretty much drowned out by that.\n\nSomething needs to change.\n\nPerhaps separation of the \"Nametag Banner\" system and \"Groups\" system.\n\nOr instead perhaps we could have the ability to label our groups as an actual \"Community Group\" versus being a \"Nametag Banner\".",
